	<description>&lt;i&gt;Every day a different body. Every day a different life. Every day in love with the same girl.&lt;br /&gt;There’s never any warning about where it will be or who it will be. A has made peace with that, even established guidelines by which to live: Never get too attached. Avoid being noticed. Do not interfere.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It’s all fine until the morning that A wakes up in the body of Justin and meets Justin’s girlfriend, Rhiannon. From that moment, the rules by which A has been living no longer apply. Because finally A has found someone he wants to be with—day in, day out, day after day.</description>
